How much storage should you plan for in a London bedroom? There is no single number that works for every home, but the right amount should comfortably accommodate your clothes, shoes, accessories and everyday belongings without making the room feel crowded. In many London properties, bedrooms can be compact, so using the available space intelligently is often more important than simply adding more furniture. When partnering with a premier <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/renovation-company-london/">residential renovation company London</a> homeowners trust, storage planning is integrated right from the architectural concept.

The best storage is usually planned around the room, rather than added afterwards.
