<h3>What other items need to be stored?</h3>
Clothes are only part of the equation. Consider shoes, handbags, bedding, towels, luggage and seasonal items when planning the room.

Storage that looks sufficient during the summer may quickly become inadequate once winter coats, jumpers and heavier bedding need to be accommodated. As we often see when calculating a <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/high-end-house-renovation-cost-london/">high end house renovation cost in London</a>, failing to budget for comprehensive storage solutions leads to costly retrofits down the line.
